Officials of the department claim that this is the biggest TDS theft case so far.
The group operator of the mall deducted the TDS and paid to the concerned financial institutions, but did not pay it in the government exchequer.
By doing this, the TDS money was deposited with itself.
On October 17, an investigation team from Mumbai had taken action in collaboration with the Jaipur Exploration Team.
During this investigation, it was found that this trader has deducted the TDS but did not deposit it.
For this reason, the TDS team had started the Income Tax Survey action on this group on Thursday.
About 15 days ago, raids and survey operations were carried out on the group of this mall operator.
Angry over this action, this trader has made it clear to the officials of the Income Tax Department that they are not yet ready to pay TDS money to the Income Tax Department.
