The spokesperson said that no classified information is under threat.
At least one hactivist group has claimed online that they are responsible for disrupting NSA's website by the DDOS attack.
The DDOS attack is designed in such a way that traffic is sent to the target website in such a large amount, until the site is closed due to the server overload.
This cyber strategy is relatively unrefined and the purpose of the attacks is not to penetrate the internal network of the target system.
