No one can make good use of money more than the creation of jobs for others.
One more thing, money is not just in the form of currency.
It would also be in the form of your health, character, love for others.
Try that you become the owner of this wealth.
A sub-inspector was killed and four others were critically injured in a direct colliding with a truck and a police jeep in Agra this morning.
A speeding jeet rammed into a truck near Tora police outpost in Tajganj police station area this morning.
Sub-Inspector Register Singh died on the spot while four constables were critically injured.
All of them have been admitted to a medical college.
