"I'm as frustrated and angry as others," he said.
I want to get your trust again.
Cebelius angrily said this sentence to a colleague sitting behind him at the House hearing yesterday after a scuffle with the Republicans, which a mic caught. Billy Long, R-Mo about whether he would need to be enrolled in Obamacare.
