Surrounded by Ganga-Yamuna on three sides, this historic city is no longer left such a plot, on which ADA can make a big residential plan.
In such a situation, he has now planned to make residential plans ahead of Jhunsi on the east, Phaphamau in the north direction and from Naini in the south.
